WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Char0 brings the toothpaste into the living room.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.067
Char0 leaves the toothpaste on the coffee table.

3
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:17.067
Char1 enters the room while Char0 is absent.

4
00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:23.067
Char1 picks up the toothpaste without Char0 observing the move.

5
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:29.167
The toothpaste moves into the cabinet; Char0’s belief remains at the table.

6
00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:31.467
MindClaw retains the separate fact and actor-specific beliefs.

7
00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:41.667
Char0 returns with an outdated belief about the toothpaste’s location.

8
00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:46.217
The helper approaches the toothpaste’s actual location.

9
00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:51.217
The helper opens the cabinet containing the relocated toothpaste.

10
00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:57.400
The toothpaste moves from the cabinet to the helper.

11
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:03.400
The retrieved toothpaste is now held by the helper.

12
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.900
The next observation closes the loop by tracking the object and Char0’s response.
